34-   description must be a concise factual description of the institution or
35-   campus, never a research-progress note.
36:   For scalability, do not download a separate brochure for every programme
37:   merely to fill duration or eligibility; leave those fields null when the
38-   central official catalogue does not state them.
39:8. official_course_url must be an official page that proves that programme. A
40:   shared official catalogue URL may be used for multiple programmes.
41-9. Map courses to the existing app career tree by reading
