43-   career_nodes. Copy career_node_id, career_node_slug, and the complete
44-   breadcrumb exactly. Never edit the database.
45:10. Prefer a direct discipline mapping. Use a clearly labelled nearest-parent or
46:   closest-specialization mapping with medium/low confidence when no exact node
47:   exists. If no responsible mapping exists, return an empty
48:   career_path_mappings array and add mapping_gap.
